# Markdown pipe separator style

To prevent AI flip-flopping and kramdown/table parsing issues, use this convention:

- In normal prose (especially bold job template names), use the **U+01C0 separator**: `ǀ`
  - Example: `**APD ǀ Single demo setup**`
- Use ASCII pipe `|` only when it is real syntax:
  - Markdown tables
  - Mermaid flowchart edge labels/conditions
  - shell/regex/code snippets where `|` is required

Do **not** change `ǀ` back to `|` in prose-only text.
